sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor A as Nhân viên / quản trị viên
    participant FE as business-store-frontend
    participant C as AdminOrderNotificationController
    participant SS as AdminOrderNotificationStreamService
    participant NL as NotificationEventListener
    participant P as AdminOrderNotificationPublisher
    participant R as Redis
    participant SUB as RedisAdminOrderNotificationSubscriber
    A->>FE: Mở màn hình quản trị đơn hàng
    FE->>C: GET /api/v1/admin/order-notifications/stream (SSE/HTTPS)
    C->>SS: subscribe()
    SS-->>FE: event connected
    Note over NL,P: Một checkout đã commit OrderPlacedEvent
    NL->>P: publish(OrderPlacedEvent)
    P->>R: Publish business-store:admin:new-order (Redis pub/sub)
    R->>SUB: Deliver message tới từng application instance
    SUB->>SS: broadcast(AdminNewOrderNotificationResponse)
    SS-->>FE: event new-order (SSE/HTTPS)
    SS-->>FE: comment keepalive theo lịch (SSE/HTTPS)
